{"id":"5eab288ce162122f","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-cor-zorn-max.md","title":"Maximal Ideal Corollary","display":"cor-zorn-max — Maximal Ideal Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-zorn-max","aliases":["58-cor-zorn-max"],"display":"cor-zorn-max — Maximal Ideal Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-lem-zorn.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-zorn-max"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-zorn-max</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-zorn-max — Maximal Ideal Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"576d33e6f68f255a\" href=\"?note=576d33e6f68f255a\" title=\"../batch14/58-lem-zorn.md\">../batch14/58-lem-zorn.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,I,M\\in V\">\\(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,I,M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\)</span> (ring-structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}max}\\vdash{}&amp;\\forall R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land0_R\\neq1_R\\to\\exists M\\subsetneq R\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;(0_R\\in M\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x+(-y)\\in M)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;(r\\cdot x\\in M\\land x\\cdot r\\in M))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall I\\subsetneq R\\;\\Bigl((0_R\\in I\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;(x+(-y)\\in I)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;(r\\cdot x\\in I\\land x\\cdot r\\in I))\\land M\\subseteq I\\to I=M\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}max}\\vdash{}&amp;\\forall R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land0_R\\neq1_R\\to\\exists M\\subsetneq R\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;(0_R\\in M\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x+(-y)\\in M)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;(r\\cdot x\\in M\\land x\\cdot r\\in M))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall I\\subsetneq R\\;\\Bigl((0_R\\in I\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;(x+(-y)\\in I)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;(r\\cdot x\\in I\\land x\\cdot r\\in I))\\land M\\subseteq I\\to I=M\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two-sided-ideal condition is expanded locally in the Assertion; no undefined predicate is introduced.</li>\n<li>Zorn's lemma guarantees a maximal proper two-sided ideal in every nonzero unital ring.</li>\n<li>This requires AC in general.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-lem-zorn.md","status":"resolved","id":"576d33e6f68f255a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-lem-zorn.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)$ (ring-structure predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,I,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}max}\\vdash{}&\\forall R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land0_R\\neq1_R\\to\\exists M\\subsetneq R\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&(0_R\\in M\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x+(-y)\\in M)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;(r\\cdot x\\in M\\land x\\cdot r\\in M))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall I\\subsetneq R\\;\\Bigl((0_R\\in I\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;(x+(-y)\\in I)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;(r\\cdot x\\in I\\land x\\cdot r\\in I))\\land M\\subseteq I\\to I=M\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1249,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-cor-zorn-max.md|58-cor-zorn-max]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["576d33e6f68f255a","1c30d21ea7b443f6"]}